Add an initial conservative typed pre-VC normalizer for the experimental B3 verification backend. It preserves explicit bool/int checks, contracts and state schedules, abstracts demanded source axioms and nonidentity prelude definitions, and rejects unsupported features without producing a partial verification unit. Direct closed monomorphic map reads/stores now receive only same-index and different-index read-over-write helper equations, with recorded source origins; map equality stays opaque without extensionality. Polymorphic maps, collection definitions and lambda equations remain abstracted. A separate opt-in verdict runner exercises map anti-vacuity and omission controls with the packaged worker and pinned solver.
